The F-Actor model is fine-tuned on top of Llama-3.2-1B
(https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.2-1B). Only the
projector/adapter component is trained; released checkpoints that include
or require Llama 3.2 weights are Llama Materials derivatives and are
distributed under the Llama 3.2 Community License, not under the Apache
License 2.0 that covers this repository's code.

This project is built with Llama.

